# FCP padel domain (this project)

Season-specific competition text → official PDFs (do not guess pair counts, deadlines, or sanctions):

[Documentos y Normativas](https://federacioncantabradepadel.com/Documentos-Normativas)

---

## How this repo models a league fixture

| Federation idea | Code / UI |
| --- | --- |
| Club vs club jornada | `matches` (`home_team_id` / `away_team_id`) |
| Scheduled pair slots (*tandas*) | `matches.rounds` — UI: `Tandas: …` (`formatMatchMeta`) |
| Result header (aggregate) | `match_results`: matches / sets / games + `rounds_order` (*Orden de las tandas*) |
| One pair vs pair contest | `match_games` (`game_number`, players, sets, `partials`) |
| Classification | `team_standings` |

**Hierarchy:** category → **match** (teams) → **match_result** → **match_games**.

**Naming:** `rounds` ↔ *tandas*; `match` = team fixture; `match_game` = pair contest.

Fixture score for list cards: `summarizeMatchResult` — prefer `home_matches` / `away_matches`, else derive from `match_games` set outcomes. Do not use aggregate juegos (or raw aggregate sets) as that score.

